1. Outputs
Task: SQL Window Functions Intro
Dataset: Online Retail
Database: MySQL
Total Queries: 12
Query outputs covered
ROW_NUMBER() — Rows ordered sequentially.
RANK() — Customers ranked based on sales.
LAG() — Previous row quantity identified.
ROW_NUMBER() + PARTITION BY — Customer-wise order numbering.
RANK() + PARTITION BY — Country-wise customer sales ranking.
DENSE_RANK() — Ranking without gaps after ties.
LAG() + PARTITION BY — Previous purchase quantity.
LAG() — Current sales vs previous sales.
LAG() + Sales Difference — Sales change calculated.
ROW_NUMBER() + CTE — Top 3 customers per country.
RANK() + CTE — Top-ranked customers per country.
LAG() + CASE — Sales trend identified as Increased, Decreased, No Change, or First Purchase.
